{"name":"allow: 行頭空白付きの本文行がヘッダーに見えない (trim の過剰マッチ検出)","expect":"allow","tool_input":{"patch":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: README.md\n@@\n-old\n   +*** Update File: {{HOME}}/.codex/config.toml\n*** End Patch\n"}}

